WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:02.639
"Seek Paleblood to transcend the hunt."

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.500
Every Souls game begins with a goal:

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:09.600
Slay the Arch Demons. Ring the Bell of Awakening. Seek the King.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:13.420
And yet, in all of those stories, those goals were not the end.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.440
They didn't hold the answers we were looking for, but they did set us on the right path.

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:22.040
And it was on the path to these goals that we found our answers.

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:25.360
Bloodborne is no different, so we seek the Paleblood.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:27.620
"Paleblood you say?"

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:30.920
"Hmm...Never heard of it."

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:36.220
"But if it's blood you're interested in, you should try the Healing Church."

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:42.820
"The Church controls all knowledge on blood ministration, and all varieties of blood."

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:47.020
Blood ministration is the art of using blood for healing.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:52.060
In a time before the events of the game, the Healing Church became immensely powerful

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:56.020
due to the healing qualities of their special healing blood.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:01.820
Somehow they had created or found a blend that could cure any illness.

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:03.360
And so, as you would expect,

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:09.060
travelers from far and wide journeyed to Yarnham, seeking this special blood to cure their illnesses

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:13.300
Gilbert is one of these travelers. He mentions that what ailed him was incurable,

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:15.940
but that the special blood bought him time.

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.320
We ourselves were administered with Yarnham blood in the opening cutscene

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:23.900
and many sources say that we had an incurable disease as well.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.440
Blood became the focus of worship and desire and the Church was at the centre of it all.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:32.460
The Pungent Blood Cocktail item states that

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:37.640
"In Yharnam, they produced more blood than alcohol, as the former is more intoxicating."

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:42.480
And all was likely well for a time, for the Church had time to grow more powerful

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:45.600
and the Yharnam blood had time to gather a reputation.

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:49.080
But then it became clear that the blood was tainted.

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:55.620
The Antidote states that the healing blood gave rise to the endemic nightmare known as the scourge of the beast

00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:59.100
and the men who had imbibed the blood began to turn

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:01.980
arms-lengthened hair-grew blood-thirst beast.

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:06.640
And when we arrive in Yharnam, we find that there are very few humans left.

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:09.040
Coffins lie on the streets.

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:13.000
And it's clear that death had become a new part of the daily routine.

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:17.160
Frantically the Church rallied together a force to fight the beast outbreak.

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:23.920
By inspection of the Yharnam Hunter Cap, we learn of the cleric Ludwig, the first hunter of the Healing Church.

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:27.340
Ludwig recruited the men of Yharnam to serve as hunters.

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:30.040
This hunter's attire was made for new recruits,

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:35.400
but it was not nearly enough to allow ordinary men to stand any real chance against the beasts.

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:38.400
And yet, Ludwig's influence is seen throughout Yharnam

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:41.780
in the hunt that is carried out by the men of the town each night.

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:45.300
With steel and fire, the men of Yharnam fought the beasts.

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:49.600
Since the tragedy that struck Old Yharnam, fire has become a staple in the beast hunts

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.940
and is thought to cleanse impurity.

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:55.580
Certain types of beasts also have an abnormal fear of flame.

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:59.240
The Molotov Cocktail is one of the oldest hunter tools in the workshop.

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:05.320
"Sometimes, when hunters burn beasts, they appear intoxicated by the euphoria of purification."

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:11.580
Despite all these hunts, Ludwig's attempts to rally the men of Yharnam backfired in a way.

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:16.260
Those who engaged in the beast hunt became overwhelmed with fear and bloodlust

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:20.760
and their transformation into a beast was ironically fast-forwarded.

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:25.620
Different men turn into different beasts and most men of Yharnam are half-turned,

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:28.460
patrolling the streets in a hunt that may never end.

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:33.160
The same Yharnamites hide indoors and , as you've probably experienced,

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:37.940
they spurn the outsider stupid enough to be caught outside on the night of the hunt.

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:40.660
We fight our way through the moonlit streets,

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:47.480
trying to find this valley to the east of Yharnam, and the great bridge that will lead us to the Cathedral Ward.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:51.320
"Normally, they wouldn't let you near the place, but..."

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:53.420
"the hunt is on tonight."

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:56.440
"This might be your chance."

00:03:56.620 --> 00:04:01.480
"Ludwig was the first of many Healing Church hunters to come, many of whom were clerics."

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:05.320
"As it was, clerics turned into the most hideous beasts."

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:08.260
The Cleric Beast leaps from the Cathedral Ward and

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:12.040
we fight what became of the first Church Hunter Ludwig.

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:15.340
Take from this encounter that to be close to the church

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:18.500
is to transform into a more complex beast.

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:24.400
Perhaps the more insight you have into the Church's doings, the more complicated your transformation.

00:04:24.599 --> 00:04:29.839
It's something worth keeping in mind as we continue to explore, because this theme continues.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:34.220
After the Cleric Beast is defeated, one can obtain the Hunter Chief Emblem,

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:37.560
an item that belonged to the captain of the Church hunters long ago.

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:41.320
It opens one of the main church gates in the Church Courtyard,

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:46.660
which would close behind Ludwig every time he embarked on Yharnam to engage in the hunt.

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:50.320
It would then open upon presentation of the Hunter Chief Emblem.

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:56.280
But that gate has been closed ever since, for Ludwig became the Cleric Beast.

00:04:56.520 --> 00:05:00.060
And even though Ludwig gave his own humanity to lead the hunt,

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:02.780
the villagers saw only the Church's abandonment.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:07.820
This note you find reads, "When the hunt began, the Healing Church abandoned us,

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:10.460
blocking the great bridge to the Cathedral Ward,

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.920
as they burned Old Yharnam to the ground on that moonlit night."

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.700
When we go across it, the great bridge is of course still blocked.

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:21.260
So we have to find a different way to the Cathedral Ward.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:26.160
On our path through the sewers, we meet Eileen, a veteran hunter who tells us

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:29.380
that tonight is one of the worst hunts she has ever seen.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:33.520
"Prepare yourself for the worst."

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:40.580
"There are no humans left. They're all flesh-hungry beasts, now."

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:47.460
You'll notice that she stands beside an incense lantern. The incense spreads a scent that repels beasts.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:52.200
They're commonly found outside of the homes of the same experienced Yharnamites.

00:05:52.380 --> 00:05:55.580
Wherever you see a lantern, there is safety from the beasts

00:05:55.710 --> 00:06:00.169
and the people who hide inside are safe as long as they have a store of this incense.

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:05.420
We come across another lantern later, which protects a little girl from the horrors outside.

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:07.280
"Are you a hunter?"

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:09.220
"Then, please, will you look for my mum?"

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:14.360
"Daddy never came back from the hunt, and she went to find him, but now she's gone, too..."

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:18.860
Her father is a man named Gascoigne, who went on a hunt and never returned.

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.720
We find him here at the end of the sewers, in the Tomb of Oedon,

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:24.980
harvesting the blood of beasts.

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:28.840
Gascoigne is the perfect example of a man gone mad from the hunt.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:31.400
He has forgotten his child. He has killed his wife.

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:37.080
And we also have to remember that those of the Church turn into the most hideous beasts.

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:40.020
"Hunter attire worn by Father Gascoigne."

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:44.400
"The dingy scarf was once a Holy Shawl and a symbol of the Healing Church,

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:47.228
from which Gascoigne would eventually part ways.

00:06:47.228 --> 00:06:50.080
'Father' is a title used for clerics in a foreign land,

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:52.780
but there is no such rank in the Healing Church."

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:56.960
Gascoigne's attire is similar to the Hunter Garb that was created the workshop.

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:01.300
Only it's tainted by a pungent beastly stench that eats away him.

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:03.700
So why did Gascoigne leave the Church?

00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:06.700
Was it to raise his family that he had at home,

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:10.100
or was it because he found he disagreed with the new Church's teachings?

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:13.520
There is much more to the Healing Church than there seems.

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:21.100
"You're sure to be in a fine haze about now, but don't think too hard about all of this."

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:27.500
"Just go out and kill a few beasts. It's for your own good."

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:32.400
"You know, it's just what hunters do..."

